<DocsLayout
  title="Oh My Niu — the official themes & plugin framework for Niubash"
  description="Oh My Niu product page: niubash's official Oh-My-style plugin framework and bundled distribution — 27 themes, 50 plugin directories, 174 completion definitions, env packages and prompt-core; plugins are directories, themes are plugins; ships with niubash, updates independently; the catalog points at official upstreams."
  path="/en/products/oh-my-niu/"
  lang="en"
  enPath="/products/oh-my-niu/"
  jsonLdExtra={productJsonLd}
  ogImage="/og/oh-my-niu.png"
  zhBanner
>
  <header class="doc-head">
    <h1>Oh My Niu: the theme &amp; plugin framework for Niubash</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      niubash's <strong>official Oh-My-style plugin framework and bundled distribution</strong>:
      plugins are directories, themes are plugins, and the shell core only provides loading
      primitives. Out of the box you get <strong>27 themes</strong> and a family of feature plugins
      (git / docker / kubectl / zoxide / fzf…); it ships with
      <a href="/en/products/niubash/">niubash</a> as an offline baseline and then updates and rolls
      back independently. It is not a zsh compatibility layer — the useful shape of Oh My Zsh, with a
      bash body.
    </p>
    <div class="badge-row">
      <Badge text="Shell (.niu / bash)" tone="accent" />
      <Badge text="Ships with niubash · all platforms" tone="info" />
      <Badge text={latest || 'v2.0.0'} tone="warn" />
      <Badge text="MIT" tone="muted" />
    </div>
    <p class="repo-line">
      <a href="https://github.com/unixwin/oh-my-niu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        github.com/unixwin/oh-my-niu ↗
      </a>
      {stars !== null && <span class="stars">{stars} stars</span>}
      <span class="src">(repo-meta.json, measured 2026-10-19)</span>
    </p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2>Why Oh My Niu</h2>
    <p>
      People used to Oh My Zsh / fish plugin managers / PowerShell prompt frameworks expect not one
      specific theme but a model: <strong>list plugins, pick a theme, source one line — everything is
      in place</strong>. Native shells often lack that layer; oh-my-niu adds it to niubash while
      deliberately refusing to weld the framework into the shell.
    </p>
    <details class="zh-fold">
      <summary>中文原文 · Chinese original（3 张卡片全文）</summary>
      <div lang="zh-CN">
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Oh My 的形状，bash 的身体</strong>——Oh My Zsh 真正好用的不是 zsh 语法，而是「插件即目录、按可预测顺序加载」的模型；用户零学习成本。</li>
          <li><strong>shell 出原语，框架出组合</strong>——niubash 拥有加载、生命周期钩子、权限审阅、更新回滚等原语；oh-my-niu 拥有框架库、插件目录、主题与默认组合。bundled 不等于 built in——与第三方插件走同一套系统。</li>
          <li><strong>catalog 指向官方上游</strong>——niu plugin 的 bash 生态 catalog（niu plugin add oh-my-bash 即装）直指各自官方仓：上游插件一行不改即可原生运行，官方 bundle 只是选项之一。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Core features</h2>
    <p>
      A gallery of 27 themes; themes-as-plugins; the prompt-core segment registry; a Starship takeover
      mode; the feature plugin family; five new 2.0 first-party plugins; alias/completion/keybinding
      asset packs; and env packages that wire a whole toolchain in one command. Full eight-point list
      (Chinese):
    </p>
    <details class="zh-fold">
      <summary>中文原文 · Chinese original（八条特性全文）</summary>
      <div lang="zh-CN">
        <ul>
          <li><strong>主题画廊</strong>——27 款主题（plugins/theme-* 目录与 themes/*.toml 资产层一一对应）：Oh My Zsh 经典款、Powerlevel 风 p10 四款、Oh My Posh 风配色款与官方基础款。</li>
          <li><strong>主题即插件</strong>——每款主题是一个普通插件目录，与功能插件同一加载面。</li>
          <li><strong>prompt-core</strong>——提示符 API 与 segment 注册表的拥有者，默认开启；git 段解析为 niubash 原生 Vcs 段（1.4.1+），零 git 子进程。</li>
          <li><strong>Starship 接管模式</strong>——加载 starship 插件、留空 NIU_THEME，由 Starship 接管 PROMPT_COMMAND/PS1/PS2/PS0。</li>
          <li><strong>功能插件族</strong>——git、docker、kubectl、npm、jj、zoxide、direnv、dotenv、fzf、last-working-dir、thefuck、path-tools、extract、common-aliases、keybindings、command-not-found、winuxcmd-core……</li>
          <li><strong>2.0 新一方插件</strong>——command-timer、auto-env、dirmarks、git-fetch-reminder、env-sync。</li>
          <li><strong>别名 / 补全 / 键位资产</strong>——aliases/ 五组 TOML；completions/ 174 个 TOML 补全定义；keybindings/ emacs 与 vi 预设。</li>
          <li><strong>环境包（envs）</strong>——一个小 TOML 声明装哪些 wpm 包、启用哪些插件：niu env use git 一键配好原生 Git 工具链。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Install &amp; quick start</h2>
    <p>
      The bundle ships with niubash (the offline baseline, which advances with
      <code>niu self-update</code>); enabling it takes three rc lines. The <code>niu plugin</code>
      command family manages the <strong>external ecosystem</strong> (oh-my-bash, bash-it and other
      third-party sources) — a separate track from the bundled oh-my-niu. The entry file
      <code>oh-my-niu.niu</code> is re-entrant — sourcing twice is a no-op; add <code>--reload</code>
      for a full reload.
    </p>
    <div class="codeblock">
      <pre class="cmd"><code>{rcBootstrap}</code></pre>
      <CopyButton copy={rcBootstrap} label="Copy" title="Copy to clipboard" />
    </div>
    <h3>Day-to-day surface</h3>
    <div class="codeblock">
      <pre class="cmd"><code>{pluginOps}</code></pre>
      <CopyButton copy={pluginOps} label="Copy" title="Copy to clipboard" />
    </div>
    <p>
      Changing themes: edit <code>NIU_THEME</code> and reopen the terminal; keep config changes in
      <code>~/.niubashrc</code> (sourcing itself writes nothing to disk, and plugins never rewrite the
      rc without an explicit user command). To verify everything works, make the cow speak:
    </p>
    <div class="codeblock">
      <pre class="cmd"><code>{mooCmd}</code></pre>
      <CopyButton copy={mooCmd} label="Copy" title="Copy to clipboard" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Deep dive: the theme gallery</h2>
    <p>
      The gallery is not a static skin library — every theme is an ordinary plugin directory under
      <code>plugins/theme-*/</code> (<code>plugin.toml</code> metadata + a <code>*.plugin.niu</code>
      behavior), rendered by prompt-core's segment registry; the <code>themes/*.toml</code> asset
      layer serves manifest compatibility and review. Four style groups:
    </p>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Group</th><th>Themes</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {
          themeGroups.map((g) => (
            <tr>
              <td><strong>{g.group}</strong></td>
              <td><code>{g.items}</code></td>
            </tr>
          ))
        }
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="src-line">
      Source: the oh-my-niu README "First-Party Plugins" table and the plugins/, themes/ directories
      (measured 2026-10-24: 27 theme-* directories and 27 themes/*.toml, identical sets; the four
      groups above total 27).
    </p>
    <details class="zh-fold">
      <summary>中文原文 · Chinese original（目录优先 / catalog / 与 niu plugin 命令族的边界 三节全文）</summary>
      <div lang="zh-CN">
        <p><strong>目录优先模型</strong>——行为本体在 plugins/&lt;name&gt;/；packs/、aliases/、completions/、prompts/、keybindings/、themes/ 是过渡期的 manifest 兼容与审阅元数据面。新行为先进插件目录，再暴露 TOML 元数据供审阅、托管安装、更新与回滚——设计全文见仓内 docs/design.md（framework-first）。</p>
        <p><strong>catalog 指向官方上游</strong>——niu plugin 的三个内置 bash 生态源不绑 oh-my-niu——origin 直指官方上游仓，上游资产一行不改原生运行（兼容性是被 rubash 引擎测出来的事实）。</p>
        <p><strong>与 niu plugin 命令族的边界</strong>——bundle 契约：api = "niubash:plugin-bundle@0.1.0"、min_niubash = "1.0.0"（2.0 线自旧 winuxsh: 前缀迁至 niubash:）。发布档附 .sha256。更新模型：oh-my-niu 不是 niu plugin 的 source（niu plugin update oh-my-niu 报 unknown source，1.4.4 实测）——捆好的框架随 niubash 版本走（niu self-update 推进基线），update/rollback 的 spec+lockfile 机制管的是外部第三方源。旧的 niu plugin themes/doctor/review/search 内建面也已退役（niubash#145）：主题选择就是 NIU_THEME，诊断走顶层 niu doctor。</p>
      </div>
    </details>
    <h3>The catalog points at official upstreams</h3>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>catalog source</th><th>Official origin</th><th>Content</th></tr>
      </thead>
