          <li><a href="https://github.com/unixwin/oh-my-niu/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CHANGELOG ↗</a></li>
          <li><a href="/products/oh-my-niu/" hreflang="zh-CN" lang="zh-CN">Chinese edition of this page</a></li>
